  "notes": "{産|う}む means to give birth or produce something new.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ⟦{子供|こども}→子供：00554_kodomo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{産|う}む\n- Intransitive pair: ⟦{産|う}まれる→産まれる：00905_umareru⟧ (to be born)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{産|う}んでいる can mean \"is giving birth\" (in progress) or \"has given birth\" (resultant state, less common).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{子供|こども}→子供：00554_kodomo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{産|う}む: to give birth to a child\n- ⟦{卵|たまご}→卵：02222_tamago⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{産|う}む: to lay eggs\n- ⟦{利益|りえき}→利益：03673_rieki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{産|う}む: to generate profit (figurative)\n- ⟦アイデア→アイデア：10161_aidea⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{産|う}む: to produce ideas\n\nWRITING:\n- {産|う}む: give birth, produce (standard)\n- ⟦{生|う}む→産む：01899_umu⟧: give birth (less common variant)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{出産|しゅっさん}→出産：11734_shussan⟧: childbirth\n- ⟦{産|う}まれる→産まれる：00905_umareru⟧: to be born",
